summary.label:
We introduce you to the amazing world of Izzy - a funny and cheery fantasy friend. The app features 8 learning games, each having a spezial easy mode for the smallest kids of the age of 1.5+, as well as a normal mode, designed for children of the age of 2 - 5 years.

The game is especially designed for smaller children, intended to  playfully develop important skills, such as:
- coordination and fine motor skills;
- attention and logics;
- arranging of simple and more advanced forms, colors;
- playing with puzzles.

All games are designed with colorful pictures and selected beautiful music for learning and competing amazing tasks without any additional explanations.

The games offer following tasks:
- fix a broken milk bottle by matching items of different forms to corresponding holes, promotes logics and attention;
- help little birdies to find their nests, promotes color recognition;
- pick up fruits from a tree and feed you friend Izzy, promotes fine motor skills and logics;
- tap on moving soap bubbles, promotes fine motor skills;
- assemble of a series of colorful pictures;
- sort toys of different sizes;
- feed you friend Izzy by following curves with your tap;
- sort different kinds of transport to corresponding areas.

All games are accompanied by love-full soundtracks, designed to engage and entertain children. In-game sound motivate to develop attention and encourage right gameplay.

For parents.
The design is specially made without any textual information, in order to promote independent use by children, without the necessity of participation by parents.
The app is fully free of any ads or in-app purchases, making the world of Izzy totally safe for your children.
